KernelUUPS_Test
├── when authorizeUpgrade is called by EntryPoint
│   └── it should not revert
├── when authorizeUpgrade is called by self
│   └── it should not revert
├── when authorizeUpgrade is called by unauthorized caller
│   └── it should revert with Unauthorized
├── when initialize is called for the first time with valid packages
│   └── it should initialize the kernel and install root
└── when initialize is called a second time
    └── it should revert with InvalidInitialization
